OL,3,GNEWSAStories from across Yorkshire to
OL,4,Amake you smile
OL,5,
OL,6,FEvery week in Yorkshire we cover
OL,7,Fuplifting and feel-good stories about
OL,8,Fpeople, places and animals across our
OL,9,Fregion - and we like to shout about
OL,10,Fthem.
OL,12,FThis week, we feature a dance inspired
OL,13,Fby Ms Pac-Man, a community cafe serving
OL,14,F"hope and hot meals", and the 59th
OL,15,Fannual Leeds West Indian Carnival.
OL,17,FMs Pac-Man and her 1980s video game
OL,18,Fcontemporaries may not seem the most
OL,19,Fobvious inspiration for classical
OL,20,FIndian dance routines - but three
OL,21,Fperformers are channelling the 8-bit
OL,22,Fcharacters for their latest venture.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
